CHAPTER.VERS:
At the same time Tattenai came to them, the governor beyond the River, and Shethar-bozenai, and their fellow slaves, and said thus to them, Who gave you

          {+}
         a decree to build this house, and to finish this wall?

Then we asked those elders, and said to them thus, Who gave you

          {+}
         a decree to build this house, and to finish this wall?
